# Compose rules

## Scope

- `MainScreen`, network detail, future Links / grant cards
- ViewModels as the only UI→service bridge

Does **not** cover: orchestrator internals.

## Invariants

1. Material 3 + existing theme. No extra design system.
2. Global mode is a segmented control: OFF | PROXY | VPN | AUTO.
3. ZT rows: enable + Main pin. No per-ZT PROXY/VPN chips.
4. Links screen owns SSID rows, SIM rows, Other. "Save SSID" is explicit.
5. Show proxy port and "system proxy inactive" honestly.

## External docs

**Docs (if stuck):** https://developer.android.com/jetpack/compose/documentation

- last consulted: 2026-08

## Problem classes

### `Compose lint KaCall crash`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `lintDebug` aborts: `Found class …KaFunctionCall, but interface was expected` in Compose runtime detectors | Compose BOM / Compose lint jars newer than Kotlin analysis API bundled with AGP | Align Compose BOM to the AGP+Kotlin generation (e.g. `2024.12.01` with AGP 8.7 / Kotlin 2.0). Disable only the crashing detectors as a temporary bridge — do not bump AGP/Kotlin as a drive-by. |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-08 -->

### `UI starts VPN directly`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Toggle bypasses AUTO | `MainViewModel` still calls `ZerotierBVpnService.start` | Route all mode changes through orchestrator |

